{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.HeckeCurvature2Cocycle","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.HeckeCurvature2Cocycle","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.heckeResidue_eq_zero_of_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.heckeResidue_eq_zero_of_rel","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-curvature-2-cocycle.lean#L46-L53","doc":"When the Hecke relation `σ² = (q - q⁻¹)·σ + 1` holds, the Hecke\nresidue of `σ` vanishes — the cocycle has no curvature on a\ngenerator already in normal form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.ybResidue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.ybResidue","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-curvature-2-cocycle.lean#L41-L44","doc":"The **Yang–Baxter residue**\n`R_YB(σ, τ) = στσ - τστ` for adjacent generators `σ, τ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.heckeResidue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.heckeResidue","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-curvature-2-cocycle.lean#L34-L39","doc":"The **Hecke quadratic-relation residue**\n`R_H(σ) = σ² - (q - q⁻¹)·σ - 1` for a generator `σ` with deformation\nparameter `q` (and its inverse `qinv = q⁻¹` supplied explicitly so\nthe definition stays over a generic `CommRing`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:hecke-curvature-2-cocycle","label":"def:hecke-curvature-2-cocycle","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-curvature-2-cocycle.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}